      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2687.png",
      "downloads": 4997,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>YOU NEED THE ANIMATOR UPDATER PLUGIN TO MAKE MAGAZINE ALWAYS ANIMATED</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Pretty self explanatory, mag is transparent while also having functioning spring. Yeah transparent is a bit finnicky, probably could be more opaque, but the shaders settings is a bit finnicky.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\"><iframe>\n&lt;div class=\"tab-content\"&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Download the Zip&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. Open the Zip&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. Enjoy&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\"&gt;&lt;img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;P.S They can steal this mod for all I care, make it work BSG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</iframe></div></div></div>",
